<title>POLAND: BIG H1 group net at PLN 59.7 mln.</title>
<headline>BIG H1 group net at PLN 59.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA preliminary group results for the first half of the financial year, ending March 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 October 1996 - March 1997</p>
<p>    group operating profit				63.15</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit				  59.08</p>
<p>    group net profit					59.66</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA. The bank's financial year ends September 30. Comparison figures are not available. @</p>
<p>    group revenues from securities		     2.21</p>
<p>    group interest and similar revenues	    247.24</p>
<p>    group interest and similar costs		 218.93</p>
<p>    group revenues from commission		    27.94</p>
<p>    group costs of commission			    8.89</p>
<p>    group income tax					 9.94</p>
<p>    group other taxes					0.56 refund</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss				     1.21</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
